862
00:36:23,600 --> 00:36:24,080
坐下
Sit.

863
00:36:24,900 --> 00:36:25,440
别走
Stay.

864
00:36:34,840 --> 00:36:36,280
-乔  -太迟了
- Joe! - Too late.

865
00:36:36,360 --> 00:36:39,280
我刚已经把你的肾在桑给巴尔的黑市上卖掉了
I just sold your kidney on the black market in Zanzibar.

866
00:36:39,900 --> 00:36:42,820
乔  你哥哥想好好泡个澡呢
Joe, your brother's trying to take a bath.

867
00:36:42,820 --> 00:36:44,640
要尊重隐私啊
Privacy, please.

868
00:36:46,820 --> 00:36:47,700
妈  别啊
Mom, no.

869
00:36:49,420 --> 00:36:50,120
谢谢
Thank you.

870
00:36:50,460 --> 00:36:52,920
我知道你是我们家的大诗人
I know that you're the poet in the family,

871
00:36:52,920 --> 00:36:55,140
但我也给你写了点东西
but I wrote you a little something.

872
00:37:01,040 --> 00:37:01,920
妈
Oh, Mom.

873
00:37:03,280 --> 00:37:04,600
我才是幸运的那个
I'm the lucky one.

874
00:37:05,700 --> 00:37:07,680
我会很想你的  但我很激动
I'm gonna miss you so much, but I am so excited

875
00:37:07,680 --> 00:37:09,800
你要开始你自己的冒险旅程了
that you're going to have adventures on your own.

876
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:12,880
我会的
I will.

877
00:37:14,760 --> 00:37:16,020
我也会非常想你的
And I'm gonna miss you, too.

878
00:37:17,140 --> 00:37:18,580
要平安无恙地回来
Come back in one piece.

879
00:37:19,200 --> 00:37:19,820
我保证
I promise.

880
00:37:24,560 --> 00:37:25,920
你...  我这是该怎么逃出来
What... How am I supposed to get out?!

881
00:37:26,000 --> 00:37:28,220
这里有所有你逃生需要用的一切
You have everything you need to figure it out.

882
00:37:28,420 --> 00:37:30,620
降下你的心率  观察你的四周
Slow down your heartbeat, look at your surroundings.

883
00:37:37,380 --> 00:37:38,780
-这房间  -是啊
- This room. - Yeah.

884
00:37:38,780 --> 00:37:39,460
你还好吗
You okay?

885
00:37:40,700 --> 00:37:42,000
不禁让我想起来
It just got me thinking

886
00:37:42,000 --> 00:37:45,140
在我们最早刚搬进来时  那空荡荡的房子
about the empty house we first moved into.

887
00:37:46,500 --> 00:37:49,460
新婚夫妇计划着横跨美国之旅
Couple of newlyweds planning a cross-country trip,

888
00:37:49,500 --> 00:37:50,940
但我却不停孕吐
but I kept getting morning sickness.

889
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:56,760
你就搬了两个箱子  迪兰
You carried two boxes, Dylan.

890
00:37:56,780 --> 00:37:58,400
而我搬[怀]过两个人类呢
I carried two humans.

891
00:37:58,900 --> 00:38:00,740
当然是指茵素跟乔治啊  不然还能有谁
Yes, Poppy and George. Who else?

892
00:38:01,180 --> 00:38:02,960
我们当时也挺快就上手了啊
We got the hang of it pretty fast.

893
00:38:03,500 --> 00:38:06,560
是啊  我们一开始感觉自己挺行的一阵子  然后...
Yeah, we were feeling pretty smart for a while and...

894
00:38:06,560 --> 00:38:08,080
大伙们  我正在跟日内瓦的房东通电话
Guys, I'm on the phone with the landlord in Geneva.

895
00:38:08,280 --> 00:38:10,400
公寓有4.5乘11米大
The apartment he has is 4 1/2 by 11 meters.

896
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:18,380
我之后再给你答复
I'll have to get back to you.

897
00:38:18,460 --> 00:38:20,140
没有  我只是在跟着一只苍蝇的轨迹
No, no, I was just following the path of this fly.

898
00:38:20,420 --> 00:38:21,960
我答应了  对  给我几秒钟
Ugh! I'll do it. Okay, give me a second.

899
00:38:23,520 --> 00:38:25,580
你们谁的手最稳
Which one of you has the steadiest hands?

900
00:38:25,900 --> 00:38:26,620
卢克
Oh, Luke,

901
00:38:26,620 --> 00:38:28,600
上次发生后  我们去弄了备份钥匙
we got a second key the last time that happened.

902
00:38:28,640 --> 00:38:29,760
就放在厨房抽屉里  跟我过来
It's in the kitchen drawer. Come on.

903
00:38:34,960 --> 00:38:39,540
所以基本上...  25年来无休止的疯狂
So, that's pretty much... 25 years of uninterrupted crazy.

904
00:38:40,160 --> 00:38:42,140
突然一瞬间  它说结束就结束了
Then, when it ends... it ends.

905
00:38:42,780 --> 00:38:44,700
直到我们开启人生新的篇章
Until our next chapter.

906
00:38:45,520 --> 00:38:47,300
我现在只是随便想点主意  但...
I'm just brainstorming here, but, uh...

907
00:38:47,300 --> 00:38:51,620
或许我们可以去延宕多年的横跨我国房车旅了
maybe we take a long-delayed RV trip across the United States,

908
00:38:51,740 --> 00:38:55,100
并跟职棒大联盟每一队的吉祥物人偶合照
get selfies with all the Major League baseball mascots.

909
00:38:55,640 --> 00:38:58,420
我肯定是超爱你  因为我觉得听起来好有意思啊
I must really love you, 'cause that sounds fun.

910
00:39:07,060 --> 00:39:08,280
他们真的要离开了
They're really leaving.

911
00:39:09,060 --> 00:39:10,060
我们该怎么做
What do we do?

912
00:39:13,220 --> 00:39:14,940
跟所有父母一样
What people have always done.

913
00:39:15,840 --> 00:39:17,000
为游子留一盏门廊灯
Leave the porch light on.

914
00:39:18,220 --> 00:39:19,220
总有一天他们会回来
They come back.

915
00:39:23,020 --> 00:39:23,620
各位
Everyone!

916
00:39:23,880 --> 00:39:27,000
在我们叫的车来之前  我想说几句
I would like to, um, say a few words before our car comes.

917
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:30,300
其实就是两个简单的字  谢谢
Two simple words, actually... thank you...

918
00:39:30,860 --> 00:39:34,100
让我有被欢迎进这个大家庭的感觉
...for making me feel so welcome in this family.

919
00:39:35,200 --> 00:39:37,780
一个教会了我许多事物的家庭
A family that taught me so much.

920
00:39:38,320 --> 00:39:40,080
从杰那里  我学会了直接点别废话
From Jay, I learned to get to the point.

921
00:39:42,420 --> 00:39:43,940
小卡  我们就几分钟时间  能不能...
Cam, we only have a few minutes. Why don't...

922
00:39:50,600 --> 00:39:53,840
我知道大多数人在这种时刻会多愁善感
I know people tend to get mushy in moments like this,

923
00:39:53,900 --> 00:39:56,400
尽管你要去环游世界
but with you headed around the world

924
00:39:56,400 --> 00:39:58,400
我要去上大学...
and me headed off to college...

925
00:39:59,560 --> 00:40:00,240
我们会保持联系的
We'll stay close.

926
00:40:01,180 --> 00:40:02,960
你为什么从来不写诗给我啊
How come you never wrote a poem for me?

927
00:40:03,640 --> 00:40:05,000
你还不懂吗
Don't you get it?

928
00:40:05,300 --> 00:40:06,880
所有的诗都是写给你的啊
They were all for you.

929
00:40:12,240 --> 00:40:12,760
帽子[西语]
Sombrero.

930
00:40:15,800 --> 00:40:16,600
你是...
What are you?

931
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:19,020
我知道你是阳性词[阳刚的]
I know you're masculine.

932
00:40:19,260 --> 00:40:21,780
-你到底是出了什么问题  -你在说什么呢
- What is wrong with you? - What are you talking about?

933
00:40:21,900 --> 00:40:24,680
你的举止很奇怪  快吓死我了
You're acting crazy, and it's scaring me.

934
00:40:24,680 --> 00:40:27,740
你还很年轻  不应该像个老头子一样
You're too young to be acting like an old man.

935
00:40:39,900 --> 00:40:41,360
这样我今年夏天
so I'll know what's going on

936
00:40:41,360 --> 00:40:42,960
跟你去哥伦比亚时我才会知道都发生了什么
when I go with you to Colombia this summer.

937
00:40:43,420 --> 00:40:44,360
你要来吗
You're coming?!

938
00:40:44,560 --> 00:40:46,560
过去12年来你一直盯着我的家人看
You've been staring at my family for 12 years.

939
00:40:46,800 --> 00:40:48,600
我为了你  去盯你家人一个夏天也很合理
Least I can do is stare at yours for one summer.

940
00:40:49,000 --> 00:40:50,220
你真是太好了
You're wonderful.

941
00:40:50,920 --> 00:40:51,920
但不许盯他们
But no staring,

942
00:40:51,920 --> 00:40:54,580
也永远永远不许走同一条路线两次
and never, ever take the same route twice.

943
00:40:58,260 --> 00:40:59,560
好啦  大伙们  都挤过来
Okay, everybody, squeeze in.

944
00:40:59,620 --> 00:41:00,880
都挤过来拍照
Squeeze in for the picture.

945
00:41:02,500 --> 00:41:03,020
好
Okay.

946
00:41:06,380 --> 00:41:07,660
完美  我拍好了
Perfect. I got it!

947
00:41:07,800 --> 00:41:08,320
好
Okay.

948
00:41:09,740 --> 00:41:11,220
我都有点不想松手了
I kind of don't want to let go.

949
00:41:12,980 --> 00:41:13,740
对啊  我也是
Yeah, me neither.

950
00:41:14,920 --> 00:41:18,140
虽然现在是米奇舅舅与小卡要走  但...
I mean, it's Mitch and Cam now, but...

951
00:41:18,140 --> 00:41:20,140
他们三个也马上要走了
it's these three next.

952
00:41:21,440 --> 00:41:23,120
谁知道我们下次再相聚会是何时
Who knows when we'll all be together again.

953
00:41:24,120 --> 00:41:25,460
为什么这么难啊
Why is this so hard?

954
00:41:25,540 --> 00:41:28,260
这都是我们今天大概第7次要告别了
We've done this like seven times already today.

955
00:41:28,500 --> 00:41:31,660
会这么难是因为我们之间的感情非同凡响
It's hard because not everybody gets to have what we have.

956
00:41:34,260 --> 00:41:36,720
米奇尔  我把滑冰的奖杯放到你行李箱里了
Mitchell, I put the skating trophy in your suitcase.

957
00:41:36,940 --> 00:41:37,880
我想先放你那边
I want you to have it first...

958
00:41:37,880 --> 00:41:39,460
这样到时候你才会带回来给我
...so that I know you'll come back.

959
00:41:41,880 --> 00:41:43,860
好吧  我来当个模范
Okay, um... I'm gonna set an example

960
00:41:43,860 --> 00:41:45,100
第一个先放手
and be the first one to let go.

961
00:41:48,900 --> 00:41:50,080
太难受了
It was awful.

962
00:41:53,580 --> 00:41:55,280
人生变化如风云莫测
Life is full of change...

963
00:41:56,740 --> 00:41:58,960
有时风大  有时雨小
some big, some small.

964
00:42:00,460 --> 00:42:03,000
很久以前我就学会了  人可以逆风雨前行
I learned a long time ago, you can fight it...

965
00:42:03,000 --> 00:42:07,260
也可以尝试迎风潇洒起舞
...or you can try to make the best of it.

966
00:42:11,060 --> 00:42:14,580
如果有爱你的人在身旁  这一切会轻松许多
And that's all a lot easier if you've got people who love you...

967
00:42:14,580 --> 00:42:17,120
人生再大的风风雨雨  也能笑脸相迎浑不怕
...helping you face whatever life throws at you.

968
00:42:17,220 --> 00:42:19,360
至少这信念令我夜以成眠
At least, that's what helps me sleep at night.
